<title>UK: RUGBY LEAGUE-SUPER LEAGUE WORLD CHALLENGE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-SUPER LEAGUE WORLD CHALLENGE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Super League world</p>
<p>club challenge rugby league matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p> Canterbury (Australia)  58  Halifax (England)     6</p>
<p> Canberra (Australia)    66  London (England)     20</p>
<p> Warrington (England)    22  Penrith (Australia)  52</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p> Sheffield (England)     26  Perth (Australia)    22</p>
